      "effect_text": {
        "en": {
          "plain": "[Cn/Turn] Choose one of the following.\n• Charge two gauge. Then, look at all of your gauge, and put one monster and item each from among them into your hand. If your flag is \"Parade of Hundred Demons\", you may instead look at all of your gauge, and put one card from among them into your hand.\n• [Counter] Draw a card! Then, for this turn, all cards on your field cannot be [Rest] by your opponent's card effects, and if you have a card with [Duo] on your field, in your drop, or in the soul of your cards, for this turn, all 《Hundred Demons》 on your field cannot be destroyed, and their souls cannot be dropped, by your opponent's card effects.",
